  <Title type="string">Against the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Ingrid Ikeda talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</synopsis>
